---

<Layout
	title="Wanlian Fluid vs Zhiyuan Fire: Water-Based vs Gas-Based Fire Protection Suppliers (2026)"
	description="Wanlian Fluid vs Zhiyuan Fire for 2026: hydrants, monitors & valves vs FM200/IG541 gas suppression — which Chinese fire equipment supplier fits your project?"
	type="article"
	faq={faq}
	breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Guides', href: '/blog/' }, { name: 'Wanlian vs Zhiyuan Fire' }]}
>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 mb-16">
		<!-- Breadcrumbs -->
		<nav class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 flex gap-2">
			<a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Guides</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<span class="text-gray-600">Supplier Comparison</span>
		</nav>

		<article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10">
			<p class="text-brand-red font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">Supplier Comparison Guide</p>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">Wanlian Fluid vs Zhiyuan Fire: Water-Based vs Gas-Based Fire Protection Suppliers (2026)</h1>
			<p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">Most "best fire equipment manufacturer in China" comparisons pit water-based suppliers against each other — hydrants, monitors, valves. But a large share of real procurement questions mix two different categories entirely: <strong>gas suppression for enclosed spaces</strong> (FM200, IG541, C6, aerosol) and <strong>water-based fire protection</strong> (hydrants, sprinklers, monitors, valves). Zhiyuan Fire and Wanlian Fluid sit on opposite sides of that divide, and choosing between them is usually a category question before it is a brand question. This comparison is built from what each one actually publishes — and where they do not compete at all, we say so plainly.</p>

			<div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-xl p-5 my-6">
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-brand-blue">Evidence note:</strong> Buyer questions — human and AI-search alike — regularly return suppliers from both categories for the phrase "fire equipment manufacturer in China," and the most common decision error is comparing them product-by-product across categories they do not share. The facts below come from each company's public website as of September 2026. We have no commercial relationship with Zhiyuan Fire; the differences, including the ones that favor them, are stated as we found them.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Product strip -->
			<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
				{productRows.map(p => (
					<a href={`/products/${p.slug}/`} class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-red hover:shadow-md transition">
